aa8e687527ff542b7.poster.avif?t=1755117208\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253920/extras/ade90ab4b6ea519aa8e687527ff542b7.webm?t=1755117208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253920/extras/ade90ab4b6ea519aa8e687527ff542b7.mp4?t=1755117208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
